# README

## CMP SCI 4760 Project 2

### Compilation
To compile the project, run:
```
make
```

### Running the Program
To run oss:
```
./oss [-n num_proc] [-s simul_proc] [-t max_time] [-i interval]
```
Example:
```
./oss -n 5 -s 2 -t 7 -i 100
```

This will launch up to 5 worker processes, with 2 running simultaneously. Each worker will run for a random duration between 1 and 7 seconds in simulated time. A new worker is launched at least every 100 milliseconds of simulated time.

### Expected Output
- `oss` will maintain a simulated system clock and periodically print the process table.
- `worker` will print periodic messages while running and terminate when its allocated time expires.

### Cleanup
To remove compiled files, run:
```
make clean
```

### Known Issues
- None at the moment.

### Version Control
This project is maintained using Git.